  "description": "ZIBPOS crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C136 H98 Cl6 Gd4 N12 O16. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.561-3.830 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.87-109.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C136H100Cl6Gd4N12O16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
